You are in luck! The prescribed_ozone_file includes the variable NITROP_PD, which is the probability that the tropopause 
is at each level over the 5-day zonal mean for each time, level, and latitude in the file. This variable was used to set the 
file variables so4_a1, so4_a2, so4_a3, SAD_AERO, and icenuc_num set to zero below tropopause level. The threshold I used 
for this cutoff is levels below 95% of tropopause levels.

